== kill resolves a job by its command name:
rc=0
== disown by name drops the job so a later kill fails:
1
== fg by %+ selects the current job:
sleep 0.2
rc=0
== wait resolves a job by its command name:
rc=0
== bg by name resumes a stopped job:
